      "mergedPostDetails": "A couple of the users in my community found that if you see someone wearing a public avatar and their \"Allow Avatar Cloning\" is off, you can still clone or favorite the avatar by viewing the Avatar details page for the avatar. Here is a video example they sent over. https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UDgnozPYM8Q",
